                "kind": "agent",
                "actor": "claude-code"
              },
              "reason": "Monochrome by default is not the absence of an accent — it is an accent compiled to ink. The gate stays open because colour is a choice the seeds can still make, and one filled action per surface needs one colour to be filled with.",
              "collapsesTo": "--ink"
